__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/

# Forward run products are transient and regenerable from the run directory, except the
# registered closure and transfer products (SPEC_05 section 1a). The registered products, the reduction chain under occul_data/,
# the runs' inputs and the closure product, are committed: another platform rebuilds them equal
# only to the last few bits, so the bytes the accepted suites compare against live in git
# (author's decision, 30 September 2026; SPEC_00 section 2.4).
forward/*/output/*
!forward/lindal_closure/output/lindal_closure_profile.nc
!forward/lindal_transfer/output/lindal_transfer_profile.nc
forward/*/inputs/*.nc
!forward/lindal_closure/inputs/*.nc
!forward/lindal_transfer/inputs/*.nc

# `reports/` is the committed build record: REPORT_01_stepN.md and REVIEW_01_stepN.md.
# Only the per step working directories are ignored, holding what each step's acceptance
# scripts write; the scripts themselves are under tests/ (SPEC_00 v0.22 section 2).
reports/step*/
# What the regression driver writes (tests/run_regression.sh).
reports/regression/

# Standard diagnostic figures are regenerable from their product (SPEC_02 Step 5).
occul_data/*/figures/

# Working notes from the chat assistant; not part of the build record.
Claude outputs/

# The author's working documents, kept outside git.
docs/CONTROL_FILES.md
docs/USER_GUIDE.md
